{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are trapped in an endless subway platform. Observe your surroundings carefully and escape this nightmare. This is all a lie...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find clues, solve puzzles, and escape this nightmare. Sounds are an important part of the experience, so put on your headphones and listen carefully. There are no traditional weapons in this game, but you must strategically eliminate certain enemies to progress. Think creatively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814580/extras/SubwayExit_1_.gif?t=1750414359\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Subway Exit is a short walking simulator inspired by the long, repetitive corridors of subways, the unsettling atmosphere of liminal spaces, and the mysterious concept of backrooms. In this game, death is permanent. After death, you will restart from Platform 0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814580/extras/SubwayExit_2_.gif?t=1750414359\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Playtime:</strong> 30 - 120 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Warning for Flashing/Flickering Lights:</strong> Numerous lights and posters in this game will flicker. This may trigger seizures for individuals with photosensitive epilepsy.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814580/extras/SubwayExit_3_.gif?t=1750414359\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p cla